menu "NucleoOS apps"

config NUCLEO_STORE_CONSTELLATIONS
    bool "Constellations ships from the store (native app), not in the firmware"
    default n
    help
        Leaves app_constellations.cpp out of the firmware image (about 96 KB): the game is then the
        native app "stelle" of the store (docs/native-apps.md). Turn it on only in a release AFTER one
        that shipped the native loader, never in the same one (docs/app-store.md, upgrade guarantees).

endmenu
